  "body": "https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-referrer-policy/#integration-with-fetch has rotted a little (it references Step 15 of HTTP-redirect fetch, which no longer exists), but the idea is that Fetch should call into the Referrer Policy to update the referrer policy on redirect, before the main fetch follows the redirect.\n\nI can send a PR for this in a bit.\n",
